</table> <p style="margin-top:12pt; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:10pt; font-family:Arial;text-align:justify">Because the performance metric for the three-year performance period fell below the defined threshold set by the Compensation Committee, no performance shares were earned as shown in the table below.&#8195; </p> <p style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</p>
