<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid">
<td style="width:8%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left">(1)</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 8pt; font-family: Arial; text-align: left; line-height: normal;">Amounts reported in the CEO columns reflect (i)&#160;the total compensation reported in the Summary Compensation Table for <ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:PeoName" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" id="ixv-15703">Robert Kay</ix:nonNumeric>, the &#8220;CEO,&#8221; for each of 2023, 2024 and 2025 and (ii)&#160;the CAP for Robert Kay for each of 2023, 2024 and 2025. </div> </td> </tr> </table> <div style="font-size:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="text-align:start; BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Arial; font-size:8pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%">
<tr style="page-break-inside:avoid">
<td style="width:8%;vertical-align:top;text-align:left">(2)</td>
<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 8pt; font-family: Arial; text-align: left; line-height: normal;"><ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:NamedExecutiveOfficersFnTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" id="ixv-11141">Amounts reported in the <div style="white-space: nowrap; letter-spacing: 0px; top: 0px;display:inline;">Non-CEO</div> NEOs columns reflect (i)&#160;the average of the total compensation reported in the Summary Compensation Table for Jeffrey Siegel, Daniel Siegel, and Laurence Winoker for 2023; Daniel Siegel and Laurence Winoker for each of 2024 and 2025; and (ii)&#160;the average CAP for Jeffrey Siegel, Daniel Siegel, and Laurence Winoker for 2023; Daniel Siegel and Laurence Winoker for each of 2024 and 2025.</ix:nonNumeric> </div> </td> </tr> </table> <div style="font-size:3pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div> <ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:AdjToPeoCompFnTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" id="ixv-11144"><ix:nonNumeric name="ecd:AdjToNonPeoNeoCompFnTextBlock" contextRef="P01_01_2025To12_31_2025" escape="true" id="ixv-11145">
