<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <div style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 8pt; font-family: Arial; text-align: left; line-height: normal;">To calculate the CAP, adjustments were made to the amounts reported in the Summary Compensation Table for the applicable year. The deductions from, and additions to, total compensation in the Summary Compensation Table by year that were used to calculate CAP include: </div> </td> </tr> </table> <div style="font-size:12pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt">&#160;</div>
