<td style="vertical-align:top;text-align:left"> <p style=" margin-top:0pt ; margin-bottom:0pt; font-size:8pt; font-family:Arial;text-align:justify">Securities reported in this column include outstanding options to purchase 827,000 shares of common stock as well as 1,096,196 performance shares, the maximum number of performance shares that may be issued where the underlying shares have not been issued as the period over which performance is determined has not yet expired. </p></td></tr></table>
<table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE:COLLAPSE; font-family:Arial; font-size:8pt;border-spacing:0;width:100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0">
